Z||000000||Neal||12-30-2001||07:04 PM||||Ok so the car was sitting for most of the time, i just had to much other stuff to get it done, but...<P>After 4 long days of work i have the finished product...<P>The first drive of my fiero since april!!!<BR>The 3.4 feels real good and strong, even with 20km on it.<P>I had compleatly forgot what driving a fiero is like (most of the driving i did was in the girlfriends hyundai scoupe...) And do i ever love these cars.<P>Here are some pics of the (mostly) finished product<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/it_runs.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/engine_final.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FPG.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/no_heat_shields.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image010_3.jpg"> ||||reg||14
