Z||000006||Neal||12-31-2001||01:46 PM||||Yea blowing your engine before you have one ready to in pretty much bites.  If i had the choice id have one to go in FIRST.<P>The guage is a VDO 60psi fuel pressure guage, a must have with an adjusable pressure regulator.<P>The guage in the dash is an auto meter air/fuel ratio guage, witch actually doesnt tell me anything usefull...<P>Valve covers and plenum are a wrinkel finish black, the pic's dont show the wrinkel but it looks better in person.<P>Brandon email of PM me, im pretty much free for the next week, im sure i could find time to show off my car  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Just maybe if the weather warms up a little.<BR>I ended up with a toshiba pdr-m71 camera, more expensive than i was looking at but its 3mpixel and has full manual control<P>||||reg||1
